  (text "USB-C power in, 5 V only (5.1 k on each CC), fed to the Pi through its header: a Power HAT+."
    (at 30.48 40.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e7905b65-05cd-4a22-be20-38144cd4a778")
  )
  (text "U6 lets current flow one way only, is off below 4.4 V and above 6.1 V, limits at 4 A, rises in 5 ms."
    (at 30.48 46.99 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "0be62cda-4e2b-472b-897f-3f3ab727849b")
  )
  (text "Each CC line: 5.1 k to ground, and 10 k and 100 nF to an ADC pin of the RP2350,"
    (at 50.8 134.62 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "eb28d2c2-28ec-4fb4-bf5b-bd0014318350")
  )
  (text "which reads what the supply offers: 0.25-0.61 V default, 0.70-1.16 V 1.5 A, 1.31-2.04 V 3 A."
    (at 50.8 139.7 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "28e0b57d-c0de-423b-b13e-bfc3a3ff343f")
  )
  (text "Two fans in parallel: on while the Pi drives GPIO 12 high (gpio-fan), or slowed by PWM on it. Off with the Pi off."
    (at 81.28 181.61 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "d1c32b43-6486-44c8-828b-e2da34a38074")
  )
  (text "The Pi's 40-pin header. This board is a HAT under the Pi."
    (at 172.72 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "098b317e-e845-4024-98f7-38a5637353fb")
  )
  (text "HAT+ ID EEPROM"
    (at 274.32 43.18 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e55dd068-45da-479a-9f36-3e00679ba07a")
  )
  (text "Holes for the Pi's standoffs"
    (at 269.24 104.14 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "1442d2a5-57c3-4bdf-bb85-facf7c2afa8d")
  )
